      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 2 It is suggested that contact investigation be conducted for household",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0738067626953,
        78.27304077148438,
        408.7823791503906,
        87.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "and close contacts of all other index cases with pulmonary tuberculosis,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.20880126953125,
        90.27005004882812,
        370.8206787109375,
        99.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "in addition to the index cases covered in Recommendation 1.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.21780395507812,
        108.27005004882812,
        352.6407165527344,
        117.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.1858024597168,
        138.0963592529297,
        408.4043884277344,
        147.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 3 Clinical evaluation of household and close contacts for active TB is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.2718048095703,
        150.26406860351562,
        408.1796569824219,
        159.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "recommended as a priority on the basis of their risk for having or",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.05580139160156,
        162.27005004882812,
        408.1888427734375,
        171.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "developing active TB or for the potential consequences of the disease if",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06500244140625,
        174.27005004882812,
        285.2400207519531,
        183.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "it develops. Priority should be given to:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06500244140625,
        192.27005004882812,
        343.28094482421875,
        201.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "• people of all ages with symptoms suggestive of TB,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.07400512695312,
        208.15072631835938,
        241.86004638671875,
        219.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "< • children   5 years of age,",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0830078125,
        228.27005004882812,
        408.1977233886719,
        237.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "• people with known or suspected immunocompromising conditions",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.57000732421875,
        240.26705932617188,
        408.323486328125,
        249.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "(especially PLHIV) and contacts of index cases with MDR-TB or XDR-TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.69601440429688,
        252.26406860351562,
        231.79803466796875,
        261.2640686035156
      ],
      "text": "(proven or suspected).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.20001220703125,
        270.2640686035156,
        333.2618103027344,
        279.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.021785736083984,
        300.10223388671875,
        408.3214416503906,
        309.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 4 In settings of high HIV prevalence it is recommended that all household",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.19778442382812,
        312.26995849609375,
        338.2297668457031,
        321.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "and close contacts be counselled and tested for HIV.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.206787109375,
        330.26995849609375,
        333.41473388671875,
        339.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.17478561401367,
        360.09625244140625,
        408.35760498046875,
        369.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 5 It is recommended that all household contacts of an index case who is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.22479248046875,
        372.26397705078125,
        324.7657470703125,
        381.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "a PLHIV should be counselled and tested for HIV.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.23379516601562,
        390.26397705078125,
        333.4417419433594,
        399.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.2017936706543,
        420.09027099609375,
        410.1346130371094,
        429.27899169921875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 6 It is recommended that all household and close contacts of people",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.04861450195312,
        432.2728576660156,
        408.1453857421875,
        441.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "with TB who have symptoms compatible with active TB should receive",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.02162170410156,
        444.2698669433594,
        391.3333740234375,
        453.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "counselling and testing for HIV as part of their clinical evaluation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.03062438964844,
        462.2698669433594,
        352.4535217285156,
        471.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.99862289428711,
        492.09613037109375,
        408.5953674316406,
        501.266845703125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 7 PLHIV who are household or close contacts of people with TB and who,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.03062438964844,
        504.2638244628906,
        408.2091369628906,
        513.275146484375
      ],
      "text": "after an appropriate clinical evaluation, are found not to have active TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.07611083984375,
        516.2721557617188,
        369.28411865234375,
        525.2721557617188
      ],
      "text": "should be treated for presumed LTBI as per WHO guidelines.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.08511352539062,
        534.2721557617188,
        318.6770324707031,
        543.2721557617188
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, high-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0531120300293,
        562.1497802734375,
        407.9927062988281,
        573.2691650390625
      ],
      "text": "< Recommendation 8 Children   5 years of age who are household or close contacts of people",
